1
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Time to run with the big dogs!

2
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:26,000
Arctic Dogs is a animation, adventure, comedy film directed by Aaron Woodley.

3
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Animals band together to save the day when the evil Otto Von Walrus hatches a
sinister scheme to accelerate global warming and melt the Arctic Circle.

4
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:46,000
Lemmy (voice), played by James Franco.

5
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:56,000
Swifty (voice), played by Jeremy Renner.

6
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,000
PB (voice), played by Alec Baldwin.

7
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:16,000
Magda (voice), played by Anjelica Huston.

8
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Duke (voice), played by Michael Madsen.

9
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Jade / Bertha (voice), played by Heidi Klum.

10
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:46,000
Arctic Dogs (also known as Arctic Justice internationally or Polar Squad in the UK) is a 2019 animated
comedy film co-written and directed by Aaron Woodley and co-directed by Dimos Vrysellas.

11
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:56,000
The film stars the voices of Jeremy Renner, Heidi Klum, James Franco, John Cleese, Omar
Sy, Michael Madsen, Laurie Holden, Anjelica Huston and Alec Baldwin.

12
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
The film centers around an arctic fox delivery worker as he and his cohorts
attempt to stop a walrus from attempting to melt the ice caps.

13
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:16,000
Entertainment Studios released Arctic Dogs on November 1,
2019, in Canada and the United States.

14
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:26,000
The film was a major critical and commercial failure, grossing less
than a fifth of its production budget of $50 million.

15
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
Critics panned the film's lack of originality,
humor, story, and animation quality.

16
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:46,000
Despite its reception, the film spawned a franchise, including a
web series and multiple spin-off series and films.

17
01:27:50,000 --> 01:27:56,000
The tone is lighthearted.
